Description: Tools for processing seabird tracking data (GPS and GLS). Provides pipelines for enriching radar signal data with interpolated GPS coordinates, generating BirdLife-format tracking tables from breeding status and trip data, and extracting/cleaning raw GPS points from CSV and TXT files.
